p=s?"Take with at least 250 mL of water according to product instructions. Increase fibre intake gradually, and space at least 2 hours apart from oral medications.":"Incorporate into a balanced diet with adequate hydration."
o=s?"What is Isabgol?\nIsabgol is psyllium husk, a soluble dietary fibre obtained from the seeds of Plantago ovata.\n\nHow it works:\nIt absorbs water and forms an emollient gel-like material in the digestive tract. This improves stool consistency, supports bowel regularity, and provides a prebiotic substrate for beneficial gut microbiota.\n\nPractical considerations:\n\u2022 Hydration: Always consume with sufficient fluid (at least one full glass of water) to avoid risk of esophageal or intestinal blockage.\n\u2022 Gradual titration: Increase fibre intake gradually over several days to avoid transient bloating.\n\u2022 Medication timing: Psyllium can delay or reduce the absorption of certain medicines; space medication intake by at least 2 hours.\n\u2022 Clinical caution: Seek medical advice if you experience swallowing difficulty or suspected bowel obstruction.":"Botanical and nutritional profile for "+a0+". Rich in functional nutrients supporting daily metabolic and digestive health."
