B.VV=s(["Step outside within 30 to 45 minutes of waking.","View the natural sky without sunglasses or intervening window glass (contact lenses or eyeglasses are fine).","Spend 10-15 minutes outdoors on a clear day, or 20-30 minutes on an overcast day."],t.s)
