B.Op=new A.ls("Morning Ocular Photobiomodulation (Circadian Reset)",B.a4u,"Advances nighttime melatonin release by up to 90 minutes, increases deep slow-wave sleep by 18%, and elevates morning alertness.","Do NOT stare directly at the sun; individuals with retinal dystrophy or acute eye injury should consult an ophthalmologist.",B.a4x,"Meta-analyses show Cohen d = 0.68 for circadian phase advancement; 10,000 lux natural outdoor light significantly lowers evening cortisol latency.",B.VV,B.Wi)
