B.a__=s(["Inspect peanuts and grains: discard any nuts that are discolored, moldy, shriveled, or bitter tasting.","Store grains, pulses, and nuts in airtight dry containers away from humidity and warmth.","Ensure proper dry roasting: thermal roasting reduces aflatoxin concentrations by 30-45%."],t.s)
B.PA=new A.mH("haz_aflatoxins","Aflatoxin B1 (Mycotoxin)",B.no,"Potent hepatocarcinogen, acting synergistically with Hepatitis B viral infection to increase hepatocellular carcinoma risk in tropical developing nations.","Commercially certified packaged nuts undergo strict optical sorting and aflatoxin testing, making risk very low. The primary risk comes from uninspected, moldy, or visibly spoiled street commodities.",B.a__)
